atus":"unreviewed","rule":"TM1","severity":"HIGH","start_column":18,"tags":["Tool Misuse"]},{"category":"Tool Misuse","code_snippet":"- **Local folder or zip**: `add_skill(path=\"/abs/path/to/skill\")` returns a\n  one-time upload URL. Every file in the archive is stored with the skill,\n  so zip without VCS data and secrets:\n  `cd <parent> && rm -f /tmp/<name>.zip && zip -r /tmp/<name>.zip <name> -x '*/.git/*' '*/.env*' '*/node_modules/*' '*/.DS_Store'`,\n  then `curl -sS -F \"file=@/tmp/<name>.zip\" \"<upload url>\"` and delete the\n  archive. The response lists the installed URIs; nothing else to call. A\n  skill that is only a SKILL.md can go through `data=` instead.","confidence":0.75,"evidence":{},"finding":"&& rm -","finding_ids":["finding-eb77e0542a7b4d6faf451bdbc8e8f28a"],"id":"sha256:3dfe1a23652eca9f216febd7049383ab0fe78b164f1e18933c9efb188fbf58a3","intent":null,"line":118,"match_fingerprint":"da42bed49ba667f4edac8a3628fa28e5cc6bbc20fc757fb7d1ddbddd9a531ec0","message":"Tool calls are chained to bypass individual safety checks or escalate capabilities beyond what any single tool call would allow.","occurrences":[{"finding_id":"finding-eb77e0542a7b4d6faf451bdbc8e8f28a","line":118,"path":"SKILL.md","start_column":15}],"path":"SKILL.md","pattern":"Chaining Abuse","raw_count":1,"remediation":"Limit tool chaining depth and validate the output of each tool before passing it to the next. Require explicit user approval for multi-step chains.","review_status":"unreviewed","rule":"TM2","severity":"HIGH","start_column":15,"tags":["Tool Misuse"]},{"category":"Agent Snooping","code_snippet":"  injects one, names a skill that fits the task; when a task looks like one a\n  stored skill would cover; when the user asks to write, save, install, or share a skill from\n  text, a Git repository, or a local folder; when a skill should work in every\n  harness and on every machine; or when the user wants to move local skills\n  (~/.claude/skills, ~/.agents/skills, ~/.cursor/skil